parameter set deepseek-v4-pro, reviewed 2026-10-08
  DeepSeek V4 Pro (deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro) from its published configuration: 61 layers: 30 Compressed Sparse Attention layers (compression ratio 4, lightning indexer top-k 1,024) and 31 Heavily Compressed Attention layers (ratio 128, dense over the compressed entries), each with a 128-token sliding branch; 128 query heads over one shared 512-wide key-value vector, stored in FP8 with BF16 rotary dimensions (448 + 64 x 2 = 576 bytes per entry); FP4 indexer, 64 heads x 128. The multi-token prediction layer and hyper-connections are not counted.
